{
    "title": "AI Cover & Songs: Music AI",
    "description": "\u3010 AI COVER & SONGS: MUSIC AI\u3011\r\n\r\n[SING ANY SONG WITH YOUR OWN VOICE]\r\nUse Music AI to create your custom voice for yourself and listen to any song with your own voice. You're not just listening \u2013 you're the main singer. AI-powered magic lets you be the star. Try it and make your voice stand out!\r\n\r\nPick a Song. Pick a Voice. Powered by AI.\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n\r\n1. Perfect Vocal Change: Music AI\u2019s state of the art AI technology will replace the original vocals in any song with your favorite celebrities and singers to create a cover for you in just seconds, while keeping original rhythm and melody for a harmonious, natural blend. We have the most extensive voice library in the world of your favorite singers and celebrities. We will be adding new voices every week! You can request your own.\r\n\r\n2. Text to Music: With this cutting edge AI technology of ours you can generate songs with joyful melodies just with your words. Unleash your creativity, write whatever you want and hear it transform to music.\r\n\r\n3. Share it with the world: Your amazing creations will be ready to share immediately. Share your music with the unique album covers we prepare for you on social media with friends, family, and music enthusiasts.\r\n\r\n*The subscription covers Music AI\u2019s premium features.\r\n\r\n*You can cancel your Music AI subscription anytime via this URL:\r\n\r\nhttps://support.apple.com/en-us/HT202039\r\n\r\n*Only with your approval, payment can be charged to your iTunes Account.\r\n\r\n*Music AI subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off.\r\n\r\nDownload now and get your AI covers & songs now!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.feraset.co/privacy.html\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.feraset.co/terms.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u3010 AI COVER &amp; SONGS: MUSIC AI\u3011<br><br>[SING ANY SONG WITH YOUR OWN VOICE]<br>Use Music AI to create your custom voice for yourself and listen to any song with your own voice. You&#39;re not just listening \u2013 you&#39;re the main singer. AI-powered magic lets you be the star. Try it and make your voice stand out!<br><br>Pick a Song. Pick a Voice. Powered by AI.<br><br>Key features:<br><br>1. Perfect Vocal Change: Music AI\u2019s state of the art AI technology will replace the original vocals in any song with your favorite celebrities and singers to create a cover for you in just seconds, while keeping original rhythm and melody for a harmonious, natural blend. We have the most extensive voice library in the world of your favorite singers and celebrities. We will be adding new voices every week! You can request your own.<br><br>2. Text to Music: With this cutting edge AI technology of ours you can generate songs with joyful melodies just with your words. Unleash your creativity, write whatever you want and hear it transform to music.<br><br>3. Share it with the world: Your amazing creations will be ready to share immediately. Share your music with the unique album covers we prepare for you on social media with friends, family, and music enthusiasts.<br><br>*The subscription covers Music AI\u2019s premium features.<br><br>*You can cancel your Music AI subscription anytime via this URL:<br><br>https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT202039<br><br>*Only with your approval, payment can be charged to your iTunes Account.<br><br>*Music AI subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off.<br><br>Download now and get your AI covers &amp; songs now!<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://www.feraset.co/privacy.html<br><br>Terms of Use: https://www.feraset.co/terms.html",
